@startuml
title AI-Delivery-Intern Voicebot - MVP Architecture

actor Customer

rectangle "Vapi" {
    component "Telephony" as Telephony
    component "Soniox STT RT v5" as STT
    component "GPT-4.1\nMaya Orchestrator" as LLM
    component "Elliot v2 TTS" as TTS

    component "Conversation State\n& Guardrails" as State
}

cloud "Render" {
    component "FastAPI\n/webhook" as API
    database "Mock Collections\nData" as Data
}

component "Custom Tools" as Tools {
    [verify_customer]
    [log_promise_to_pay]
    [send_payment_link]
    [escalate_to_agent]
    [mark_disposition]
}

Customer --> Telephony : Voice call
Telephony --> STT : Audio
STT --> LLM : Transcript

LLM --> State : State / intent
State --> LLM : Allowed action

LLM --> Tools : Tool call
Tools --> API : HTTPS POST /webhook
API --> Data : Read / write
API --> Tools : Tool result
Tools --> LLM : Result

LLM --> TTS : Response text
TTS --> Telephony : Audio
Telephony --> Customer : Voice response

note right of State
Authentication is mandatory.

AUTH_PENDING
    |
    | verify_customer = true
    v
AUTHENTICATED

No debt disclosure
before authentication.
end note

note bottom of API
Assessment MVP:
- Static customer data
- Mock payment link
- Mock human escalation
end note

@enduml